1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,950
Caesar salad

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:02,100
isn't from Italy.

3
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,150
Not even close.

4
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,250
Not Julius.

5
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:05,200
Not Rome.

6
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:06,850
Not even Italy.

7
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,950
It was invented in Tijuana, Mexico,

8
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,150
in the 1920s,

9
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:11,500
